     A                                  6  1'Enter a combined requesting depart-
     A                                      ment / charge department key.  Dete-
     A                                      rmination'
     A                                  7  1'of a requisition approval path wor-
     A                                      ks as follows:'
     A                                  9  3'-  If requesting dept equals charg-
     A                                      e dept, use charge dept to determin-
     A                                      e path.'
     A                                 11  3'-  If requesting dept doesn"t equa-
     A                                      l charge dept, check for the combin-
     A                                      ed key'
     A                                 12  6'of that req/charge dept.'
     A                                 14  3'-  If the combined key doesn"t exi-
     A                                      st, use charge dept to determine pa-
     A                                      th.'
     A                                 16  3'-  If the combined key does exist,'
     A                                 16 38'there are 3 possibilities:'
     A                                 17  8'1.  Use charge dept the determine'
     A                                 17 42'path.'
     A                                 18  8'2.  Use requesting dept to determi-
     A                                      ne path.'
     A                                 19  8'3.  Use a combination of charge de-
     A                                      pt path and req dept path.'
     A                                 21  1'Enter the desired combined key, an-
     A                                      d "1", "2", or "3" to specify one'
     A                                 21 69'of the'
     A                                 22  1'above possibilities.'
